                  <photoshop:LayerText>3 years of experience working in a corporate environment as a  front-end Ul/Web developer.   Experienced in designing wireframes, prototypes, information  architecture, navigation, visual elements and interface based  on usability principles. Strong technical skills in complex website development including  web-based applications. Good amount of work done on Reactive forms or Web Forms in  Angular and their Validations. </photoshop:LayerText>
